{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vRjUEdhNyK1795418129.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>港島南岸Blue Coast租務持續活躍，優質大戶型單位屢獲租客垂青。美聯物業港島南岸項目分行助理聯席董事蕭振邦表示，該行剛促成Blue Coast一個781實呎三房單位租務成交，以月租4.2萬元獲承租。</p><p><br/>蕭振邦稱，剛成交的Blue Coast單位為5座中層B室，實用面積約781平方呎，為三房連套房間隔，以月租4.2萬元成交，折合實用呎租約53.8元。屋苑新簇，交通方便，加上單位間隔實用，租金水平合理，故獲租客垂青承接。</p><p><br/>資料顯示，業主於2024年10月以約1,782萬元購入上述物業，若以目前租金水平計算，租金回報率約2.8厘。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:24:00.507147+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":267,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T07:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T17:37:37.364660+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T08:17:18.286363+00:00","content_hash":"6e78ae0f8db40778d74126f91b24bc076e7a402992c06e5ca776ceb173f61c9f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:24:00.507147+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}